# 4. Repository Layout

```
.
├── CLAUDE.md
├── Dockerfile                  # Root, multi-stage: frontend build -> backend runtime
├── docker-compose.yml          # app + postgres(pgvector) + redis
├── .dockerignore  .env.example  README.md
├── pyproject.toml  alembic.ini
├── data/corpus/                # FDA/DailyMed Markdown files + glossary
├── backend/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── main.py             # App factory + lifespan
│   │   ├── core/               # config, security, logging, errors, deps
│   │   ├── api/                # Routers only: health, ask, auth, admin
│   │   ├── schemas/            # Pydantic v2 request/response/domain schemas
│   │   ├── services/           # Business logic (no infrastructure imports)
│   │   ├── repositories/       # protocols.py + SQLAlchemy implementations
│   │   ├── models/             # SQLAlchemy ORM models
│   │   ├── providers/          # LLM, embeddings, Redis adapters (ACL)
│   │   ├── agent/              # pipeline.py, plan.py, retrieve.py, tools/, review.py, answer.py, events.py, prompts/
│   │   └── ingestion/          # CLI: python -m app.ingestion
│   ├── migrations/             # Alembic (async env)
│   └── tests/                  # unit/, integration/, fakes/, factories.py, conftest.py
├── frontend/src/               # components/, features/{chat,auth,admin}/, hooks/, lib/, stores/, types/
└── e2e/                        # Playwright specs, page objects
```

